      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "AController*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FRotator",
      "docs": "Get the control rotation. This is the full aim rotation, which may be different than a camera orientation (for example in a third person view),\nand may differ from the rotation of the controlled Pawn (which may choose not to visually pitch or roll, for example)."
    },
    {
