    {
      "id": "line-of-sight-to",
      "name": "LineOfSightTo",
      "category": "Controller",
      "signature": "LineOfSightTo(Target, Other, View Point, Alternate Checks)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "AController*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Other",
          "type": "AActor*"
        },
        {
          "name": "View Point",
          "type": "FVector",
          "default": "FVector(ForceInit)"
        },
        {
          "name": "Alternate Checks",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Checks line to center and top of other actor\n@param Other is the actor whose visibility is being checked.\n@param ViewPoint is eye position visibility is being checked from.  If vect(0,0,0) passed in, uses current viewtarget's eye position.\n@param bAlternateChecks used only in AIController implementation\n@return true if controller's pawn can see Other actor."
